{"title": "Shield Trader Table", "pageid": 44909, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shield_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Shield Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_Shield</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Shield+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Shield+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing non-body <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Shield Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<i>Every item that the player is eligible for is dropped. E.g. at level 4, both Padded Armour +1 and Leather Armour +1 are dropped.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Up to level 9\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(item)\" title=\"Shield (item)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Item_WPN_HUM_Shield_D_0_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(item)\" title=\"Shield (item)\">Shield (item)</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 11+\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_%2B1\" title=\"Shield +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_%2B1\" title=\"Shield +1\">Shield +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time